  "rewards": [
   {
    "text": "活动期间登录领 S 级知更鸟、升至 40 级的养成材料和一套推荐主属性驱动盘。",
    "textEn": "Log in during the event for S-Rank Robin, materials to raise her to Lv. 40, and a Drive Disc set with recommended main stats."
   },
   {
    "text": "12 月 2 日 05:59（UTC+8）前完成网页预约与活动玩法，更新后登录可领 160 菲林和纪念名片。",
    "textEn": "Pre-register and finish the web activity before Dec 2 at 05:59 (UTC+8), then log in after the update for 160 Polychromes and a commemorative namecard.",
    "until": "2026-12-02T05:59:00+08:00",
    "source": {
     "title": "预约活动",
     "titleEn": "Pre-registration",
     "url": "https://www.miyoushe.com/zzz/article/79679325",
     "urlEn": "https://zenless.hoyoverse.com/en-us/news/167395"
    }
   },
   {
    "text": "梦现追影第三关「薪火之影」已解锁。",
    "textEn": "Stage 3 of Dream Manifestation: Chasing Shadows is open.",
    "from": "2026-11-22T18:00:12+08:00",
    "until": "2026-12-02T05:59:00+08:00",
    "source": {
     "title": "前往活动",
     "titleEn": "Open event",
     "url": "https://mhyurl.cn/iaO2IK26H",
     "urlEn": "https://hoyo.link/5yqHKFHnS"
    }
   },
   {
    "text": "邀请好友回归或注册，最多可得 340 菲林。1 月 13 日 05:59（UTC+8）截止。",
    "textEn": "Invite friends to return or register to earn up to 340 Polychromes. Ends Jan 13 at 05:59 (UTC+8).",
    "until": "2027-01-13T05:59:00+08:00",
    "source": {
     "title": "前往活动",
     "titleEn": "Open event",
     "url": "https://mhyurl.cn/iaO2IK26H",
     "urlEn": "https://hoyo.link/5yqHKFHnS"
    }
   },
   {
    "text": "「决战于黎明之前」累计签到 7 天送 480 菲林。版本签到另有 1,840 菲林、10 加密母带、10 邦布券及帕姆主题配饰。",
    "textEn": "Check in for seven days in The Final Battle Before Dawn for 480 Polychromes. Version check-ins also give 1,840 Polychromes, 10 Encrypted Master Tapes, 10 Boopons, and a Pom-Pom accessory."
   },
   {
    "text": "参与「戏梦不知归处」可免费领取邦布帕姆。",
    "textEn": "Play Lost in a Theatrical Dream to claim the Pom-Pom Bangboo."
   },
   {
    "text": "参与游戏内玩法可免费获得佩洛伊斯的影画和音擎进阶材料。",
    "textEn": "Play in-game activities to earn Pyrois's Mindscapes and W-Engine overclock materials for free."
   }
  ],
